    "description": {
      "value": "<p>The [[lookup @name lowercase]] animates [[lookup @target.affects.special activity=lydBv987ChZ7itoS]] it can see within [[lookup @range.value activity=lydBv987ChZ7itoS]] feet of itself. Each boulder uses the @UUID[Compendium.dnd-monster-manual.actors.Actor.mmGalebDuhr00000] stat block, except it has Intelligence and Charisma scores of 1 and lacks this action. The boulder takes its turn immediately after the [[lookup @name lowercase]] on the same Initiative count, and it obeys the [[lookup @name lowercase]]. A boulder remains animate for [[lookup @duration.value activity=lydBv987ChZ7itoS]] minute or until it or the [[lookup @name lowercase]] dies.</p>",
